// Quoted: the label contains a space.
//
// This mode maps to the SAME constant as `alpha` in the mode table
// (wz3_bitmap_ops.ops:683 — BI_ALPHA appears twice, at index 4 and index 11), so
// the table alone suggests the two are duplicates. They are not: index 11 gets a
// trailing `out->PreMulAlpha()` after the merge (:706), and the checksums
// confirm they differ.
//
// Worth knowing before reading the table as a bug, and worth knowing when
// judging "two modes match means one is ignored" — for this pair the difference
// is real but small.
op GenBitmap.Merge at 77,1 size 6x1 {
  name = merge_premul
  Mode = "premul alpha"
}
